[{"id":161583756,"discussion_id":"c854f366ff2c95f60c5bab421a6f34a48ed55ac5","body":"\nThanks for your pull-request.\n\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC).\n\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n","created_at":"2026-01-29T10:53:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-29T10:53:29+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161583759,"discussion_id":"e7f09319e3ce22ee74d6586bf0dd1d85c257c31e","body":"以下是根据您提交的修改文件推荐的Reviewer和Committer序列，需各模块评审通过后方可合入\n| Module List | Reviewers | Committers |\n|-------|-------|-------|\n| conv     | N/A    | [*crystalhu*](https://gitcode.com/crystalhu), [*lileizheng*](https://gitcode.com/lileizheng), [*zhang-wu*](https://gitcode.com/zhang-wu), [*zhangyuxiang0119*](https://gitcode.com/zhangyuxiang0119), [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2)    |\n","created_at":"2026-01-29T10:53:30+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-29T10:53:30+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161583777,"discussion_id":"04e466760084e5014658e4985014bf442e9765d8","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-29T10:53:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-29T10:53:38+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161584159,"discussion_id":"7d831a71e98ade4863bca65793fa19db546f0009","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复3D卷积反向传播输入算子（Conv3DBackpropInputV2）在`TILING_HK`切分模式下，当输入宽度为1时的L1内存占用计算逻辑错误。原逻辑在此特殊场景下错误地沿用了`TILING_HK_WK`模式的计算公式，导致L1内存需求被低估，可能引发运行时内存溢出或性能问题。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了`IsL1ParamsValid`函数中计算左矩阵（A矩阵）L1内存占用（`a1PixelNum`）的条件判断。将原复合条件简化为仅当`tilingHkWkMode == TILING_HK_WK`时才使用简化的固定块大小计算公式。对于`TILING_HK`模式，无论输入宽度是否为1，均统一使用基于实际特征图高度的通用计算公式，从而确保内存评估的准确性，消除潜在的内存溢出风险。","created_at":"2026-01-29T10:55:33+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-29T10:55:33+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161584365,"discussion_id":"5c152917a1c62e1505239b77278aa1e0e1d2c186","body":"### 逻辑错误: 修改后的条件判断逻辑存在缺陷。原代码行529-531中，当 `tilingHkWkMode == TILING_HK_WK` 或 (`tilingHkWkMode == TILING_HK` 且 `runInfo_.dedx_w == 1`) 时，会执行 `a1PixelNum = BASIC_BLOCK_SIZE_256 * coutNum`。修改后（第530行）仅保留了 `tilingHkWkMode == TILING_HK_WK` 的条件，移除了 `(tilingHkWkMode == TILING_HK && runInfo_.dedx_w == 1)` 这一分支。然而，结合代码上下文分析，在 `IsL1ParamsValid` 函数中（第527行）和 `EqualL1MatchStepMNK` 函数中（第770-772行），都明确处理了 `TILING_HK` 且 `runInfo_.dedx_w == 1` 的“特殊场景”，并使用了相同的逻辑（`a1PixelNum = BASIC_BLOCK_SIZE_256 * coutNum` 或 `curHiWiSize = static_cast<uint64_t>(dtypeByteL0a_) * BASIC_BLOCK_SIZE_256`）。修改后，`IsL1ParamsValid` 函数中对于 `TILING_HK` 且 `wi=1` 的场景将不再使用 `BASIC_BLOCK_SIZE_256` 的特殊计算，这可能导致 `aL1Size` 计算错误，进而影响 L1 内存大小的合法性判断 (`IsL1ParamsValid`)，最终可能导致 tiling 策略错误或内核执行失败。\n\n**问题类型**: 逻辑错误\n**文件路径**: `conv/conv3d_backprop_input_v2/op_host/op_tiling/arch35/conv3d_backprop_input_v2_inner_product_tiling.cpp`\n**行号**: 530\n**问题代码**:\n```cpp\n    if (tilingRunInfo_.tilingHkWkMode == TILING_HK_WK) {\n        a1PixelNum = BASIC_BLOCK_SIZE_256 * coutNum;    // 切hkwk时, 无需加载完整wo, 且此时最大baseM为256,切hk时，wi=1特殊场景\n    }\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n恢复原条件判断逻辑，或者确保在 `TILING_HK` 且 `runInfo_.dedx_w == 1` 的场景下，`a1PixelNum` 的计算逻辑与 `EqualL1MatchStepMNK` 函数保持一致。建议修改为：\n    if (tilingRunInfo_.tilingHkWkMode == TILING_HK_WK || (tilingRunInfo_.tilingHkWkMode == TILING_HK && runInfo_.dedx_w == 1)) {\n        a1PixelNum = BASIC_BLOCK_SIZE_256 * coutNum;    // 切hkwk时, 无需加载完整wo, 且此时最大baseM为256,切hk时，wi=1特殊场景\n    }\n同时，检查注释是否需要更新以准确反映两种场景。\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-01-29T10:56:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-29T10:56:38+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":false,"diff_position":{"start_new_line":530,"end_new_line":530,"start_old_line":530,"end_old_line":530,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":161604627,"discussion_id":"aed9e309a9f82c7e7b59325240637766d3d8f276","body":"以下是根据您提交的修改文件推荐的Reviewer和Committer序列，需各模块评审通过后方可合入\n| Module List | Reviewers | Committers |\n|-------|-------|-------|\n| conv     | N/A    | [*crystalhu*](https://gitcode.com/crystalhu), [*lileizheng*](https://gitcode.com/lileizheng), [*zhang-wu*](https://gitcode.com/zhang-wu), [*zhangyuxiang0119*](https://gitcode.com/zhangyuxiang0119), [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2)    |\n","created_at":"2026-01-29T14:20:14+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-29T14:20:14+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161604648,"discussion_id":"c36220ba6296dae194ea80e3f1bf28ca6b3eb751","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n Zehai, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-01-29T14:20:20+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-29T14:20:20+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161604654,"discussion_id":"1c3e2da54cde2942248fa9cf74f760a057e9ccc2","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-29T14:20:22+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-29T14:20:22+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161604957,"discussion_id":"45be01401e04d8398104732dffbae7ae97a30f99","body":"/compile","created_at":"2026-01-29T14:22:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-29T14:22:06+08:00","user":{"id":"6752ba03b5b8bb7550ec8869","login":"Zehai","object_id":"6752ba03b5b8bb7550ec8869","name":"Zehai","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/ba/fb0b969a457e994c79e3d164e97d7724dcaaf946d3ab32e0edb5728c53